      "refersTo": "chip",
      "description": "Светлый обычный и лаймовый выбранный чип; состояние задаёт приложение.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-chips\"><button class=\"ds-chip ds-chip-selected\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Все</button><button class=\"ds-chip\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Кроссовки</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-chips{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}.ds-chip{font-family:var(--font-text,Montserrat,Arial,sans-serif);min-height:44px;padding:8px 16px;border:0;border-radius:0;background:var(--surface,#f3f3f3);color:var(--foreground,#111);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:none;transition:transform 140ms cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1)}.ds-chip-selected{background:var(--brand,#ccff02)}.ds-chip:active{transform:scale(.97)}.ds-chip:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--foreground,#111);outline-offset:3px;}@media(max-width:767px){.ds-chip{padding:8px 11px;font-size:13px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-chip{transition:none}}"
