      "description": "Образец визуальных состояний; длину заполнения, отметки и значения вычисляет существующее приложение.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-meter\" aria-label=\"Шкала скидки: образец состояний\"><div class=\"ds-meter-track\"><span class=\"ds-meter-fill\"></span><b class=\"ds-meter-point ds-meter-reached\"></b><b class=\"ds-meter-point\"></b></div><div class=\"ds-meter-labels\"><span class=\"ds-meter-achieved\">Достигнуто</span><span>Следующая ступень</span></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-meter{font-family:var(--font-text,Montserrat,Arial,sans-serif);padding:9px 14px 7px;border-radius:0;background:var(--foreground,#111);color:var(--background,#fff);box-shadow:none}.ds-meter-track{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:14px;margin:0 4px}.ds-meter-track:before{position:absolute;content:\"\";left:0;right:0;top:50%;height:4px;background:#626262;transform:translateY(-50%)}.ds-meter-fill{position:absolute;left:0;top:50%;width:100%;height:4px;background:var(--brand,#ccff02);transform:translateY(-50%) scaleX(.5);transform-origin:left center}.ds-meter-point{position:relative;width:14px;height:14px;border:2px solid #777;border-radius:0;background:#777;color:var(--foreground,#111)}.ds-meter-reached{border-color:var(--brand,#ccff02);background:var(--brand,#ccff02)}.ds-meter-labels{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:3px;font-size:13px}.ds-meter-achieved{color:var(--brand,#ccff02)}"
